WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.710
Risa...

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:05.110
This is your home.

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:06.420
Do you understand?

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.970
What happened to her?

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:13.210
I found her on my way back from 
school, so I called out to her,

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:15.910
but she didn't respond and 
has been acting strange.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.700
It's like she doesn't remember me,

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.800
or even where her own house is.

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:24.120
Risa, what's wrong?

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.020
Risa!

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.040
Makita-san...

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:47.480
it feels like I'm losing my mind.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:49.710
Seeing an illusion like that...

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:53.100
A giant caterpillar, huh?

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:56.690
I wonder what could've made
you see something like that.

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:57.920
I don't know.

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:00.860
But I was so scared...

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:03.640
When I think that I might see it again...

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:04.660
Hey, Risa.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:08.100
Why don't we got for a walk,
see if it improves your mood?

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:12.950
Being in this dark room all day might
be what's making you see things.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:22.420
First, I need you tell you something...

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:24.470
What?

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.310
I love you.

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:29.890
I told you that here once before...

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:31.830
Do you remember?

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:35.060
No.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:36.600
I see...

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:42.090
I wonder what it feels like to get amnesia.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:45.610
The thought of losing my own memories...

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:48.620
Just imagining it is scary.

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:52.230
All those precious moments,
just going away?

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:53.750
I couldn't stand it.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.320
I know, Risa.

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:01.060
Why don't you come by my house?

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:05.260
Dad will be home, but he's in bed sick. 
You don't have to worry about him.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.800
Come on, let's go.

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:14.640
What's wrong? Just come on in.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:17.600
Dad?

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:18.770
You awake?

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:20.310
I'm back.

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:22.310
Risa's here to visit.

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:26.360
Guess he's asleep.

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:29.740
Is your father's illness serious?

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:33.300
Yeah. He used to be a professional writer,

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:35.620
but he can barely write at all anymore.

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:39.060
He used to write novels 
with historical settings.

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:40.330
What about your mother?

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:43.470
She died not long after I was born.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:49.760
Having trouble relaxing?

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.810
N-No...

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:52.960
I get it.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:56.480
This is your first time coming here,
as far as you remember.

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:59.920
But you've come over a few times before.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:06.420
Wh-What's that sound?

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:08.680
Oh, that's Dad.

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.070
I guess he woke up.

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:13.290
This'll be your second time meeting him.

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:32.390
Hey, Risa-san. Glad you came by.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:35.560
Dad, you shouldn't push yourself.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:36.450
You need to rest.

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:38.780
I can't do that, Shuuichi.

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:41.730
Risa-san's going to marry you, after all—

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:43.890
Dad! What are you saying?

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:45.810
She lost her memories, remember?

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:49.580
I guess that's true, poor dear...

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:53.230
But that will heal in time.

00:05:53.230 --> 00:05:54.760
No need to worry.

00:05:54.760 --> 00:06:00.370
Meanwhile, my own body is just
going to degrade over time...

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:03.560
I don't have long left, I think.

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:07.170
When I'm gone, Risa-san,

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:11.500
please take care of Shuuichi.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:15.880
Dad, don't say stuff like that!

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:19.030
Besides, Risa lost her memories,

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:22.180
so she doesn't remember
us getting engaged.

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:24.980
Don't complicate things, okay?

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:26.770
Right, I guess that's true.

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:30.420
Those kinds of things should be 
dealt with by the parties involved.

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:33.130
In that case, I'll get out here.

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:36.290
I'm starting to get tired,
so I should rest some more.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:40.120
Well, Risa-san, you enjoy yourself.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:43.950
Please do take good care of Shuu-chan,

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:46.100
dear young lady.

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:01.840
<i>This feeling of anxiety...</i>

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:04.020
<i>I can't put it into words,</i>

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:07.560
<i>but I saw something terrible there.</i>

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:11.450
<i>Something so terrible, I lost my memories...</i>

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:15.910
<i>I've just been more nervous since
I went to Makita-san's house.</i>

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:20.450
<i>The cause of my amnesia
might be at that house of his!</i>

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:24.340
Risa, Makita-kun is here!

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:28.340
What are you doing? Hurry along.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:31.160
Makita-kun's waiting at the front door.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:33.460
He seemed to be in a hurry.

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:39.060
Risa, I'm sorry to spring this 
on you, but it's important.

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:42.800
Dad's suddenly deteriorated
into critical condition.

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:46.280
He's been mumbling about
how he wants to see you.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.230
Can you come over right now?

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:50.440
B-But...

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.760
Please!

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:01.370
Dad? I brought Risa!

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:03.580
Dad, do you understand me? Risa's here!

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:17.810
These are the assembled
craniums of my ancestors.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:21.170
The head right on top of Dad's

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:22.900
is my aunt's.

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:25.190
Then there's my grandma's...

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:28.000
Then my great-uncle's.

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:32.480
Above that is my great-grandma, 
then my great-grandpa and his siblings.

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:34.990
Then my great-great grandpa...

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:39.290
All their brains connected together like that.

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:43.120
And by linking with their brains,

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:45.480
my Dad's able to share their memories.

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:47.080
Shuuichi!

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.410
I'm done for...

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:51.920
I won't last more than a few hours.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:55.410
Hurry and do what needs to be done!

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:58.550
We need an heir!

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:00.240
Yes, Dad.

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:01.970
I know.

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.980
Because I'm going to

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:07.940
be a part of this aggregation someday...

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.660
I remember.

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:12.400
I remember it all now!

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:14.740
Risa!

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.170
You've remembered?

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:20.620
So you remember how I proposed to you, too?

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:24.120
And you said yes, didn't you?

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:27.330
You said you'd marry me, right?

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:28.850
B-But...

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:30.850
There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:36.010
You just need to give birth to a
child who can inherit my wisdom.

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:40.320
I'm all that's left of the Makita bloodline now...

00:09:40.690 --> 00:09:42.980
So I have to have an heir,

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:46.060
or our line will perish.

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:50.820
All the memories we've accumulated
over these years will be for nothing.

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:54.240
I can't allow that to happen!

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:58.200
I can't marry you!

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:02.470
No!

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:04.120
Wait!

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:13.700
Risa.

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:19.170
You tripped over the heads of my ancestors 
that extend from my dad's.

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:21.550
I don't have any time left...

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:23.720
I won't let you go.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.980
No! Stay away!

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:30.220
My head...

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:36.820
Dad...

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:41.040
Dad is...

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:01.140
What just happened?

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:12.240
<i>The top of his head is missing...</i>

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:33.150
What are you doing, Shuu-chan?!

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:35.000
Hurry and catch that girl!

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.640
That's right! Hurry!

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:40.530
If you let her go, it's going to be that
much harder for you to find a wife!

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:43.050
Quickly, now! Make sure she can't flee!

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:45.610
I get it... I get it already!

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:48.210
Auntie, Great-Uncle, shut up for a second!

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:53.310
If I knew Dad was dying already,
I'd have acted sooner!

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:54.680
Don't worry.

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:56.810
I'll make Risa marry me.

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:01.240
Wait, Risa!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.320
I won't let you escape!

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:08.700
Risa! Risa!

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:11.700
Risa!

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:23.430
What a beautiful bride.

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:24.790
So true!

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:28.050
Now, let's have the wedding
ceremony for you two.

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:29.760
What a relief!

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:33.210
Now the Makita family
will be stable for a while.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:35.770
'Tis worth celebrating!

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:42.070
Collection No. 088

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:42.070
<b>Honored 
Ancestors</b>

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:44.930
<i>The circus!</i>

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:46.050
<i>It's the circus!</i>

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:47.830
<i>The circus is in town!</i>

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:54.830
<i>I was shocked that a major circus would
come to a backwoods town like this.</i>

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:15.140
Collection No. 027

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:15.140
<b>The Circus
Comes To Town</b>

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:17.600
<b>The Papyrus Grand Circus</b>

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:20.710
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:23.570
welcome to the Papyrus Grand Circus!

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:29.270
Tonight you'll be joining us on a
journey to a world of dreams!

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:32.890
First up are the hilarious
tricks of our jolly clowns!

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:35.510
They're all riding balls together!

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:37.080
Clowns!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.790
Real clowns!

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:40.420
I've never seen one before!

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:49.900
What a goofball!

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:51.490
Better get up, quick!

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:54.430
Whoa...

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.740
What's the holdup?

00:13:56.740 --> 00:13:57.900
Get him out of here.

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:06.570
Now, then,

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:10.740
our next act is one you've all 
surely been waiting for...

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:14.290
The brilliant young lady, 
and the only one among our number,

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:17.230
Lady Lelia's thrilling tightrope act!

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:20.000
Take a good look!

00:14:23.030 --> 00:14:24.240
<i>It's her!</i>

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:28.220
<i>I knew she must've been
working for the circus.</i>

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:32.180
<i>When I heard the circus had come to town,</i>

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:34.420
<i>I thought that might be the case.</i>

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:43.500
<i>I wonder where she came from...</i>

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:46.570
<i>I bet the guys sitting next to me 
are thinking the same thing.</i>

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:48.570
<i>Not just that.</i>

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:54.010
<i>I bet most of the people here feel that way.</i>

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:56.720
<i>That she might be here...</i>

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:59.580
<i>Like she was drawing us to this place.</i>

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:11.360
And if you thought that was amazing,

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:14.160
a three-person tower will now 
cross the same tightrope!

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:17.700
There's no net here if they fall.

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:19.920
Just hard ground and a trip to the afterlife!

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:22.400
You'll forgive him if that pole
gets a bit shaky, won't you?

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:28.740
What's the hold up?

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:29.830
Get them out of here.

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:30.440
Right!

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:31.530
Okay...

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:34.190
No need to worry, ladies and gents!

00:15:34.190 --> 00:15:36.100
They just fell to the ground!

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:38.400
Good thing they didn't land in the sea!

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:40.830
They could've drowned and become shark food!

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:47.860
Now, everyone, the moment
you've been waiting for...

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:50.140
Knife Joe!

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:53.690
When a knife leaves Joe's hands,
it's thrown with pinpoint accuracy!

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:55.680
And his target will be...

00:15:56.710 --> 00:15:58.580
a blonde beauty!

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:00.610
Oh, nooo!

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:03.460
Eek!

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:05.910
No!

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:15.370
Well, ringmaster?

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:17.700
I'm the stand-out act in this bunch.

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:19.450
Now Lady Lelia is mine.

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:20.890
We'll see about that.

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:21.720
What?!

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:22.960
Well, go on, man!

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.830
You've still got knives left.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:27.380
Damn walrus...

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:28.540
Just watch.

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:36.610
Whoa, it landed somewhere crazy!

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:39.390
No way... I wouldn't screw up like that...

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:41.470
The stand-out act, eh?

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:42.980
Damn it!

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:44.440
Just watch!

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:54.350
Holy crap, how'd they pull that trick off?

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:55.880
That's some great acting!

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:56.820
What's the holdup?

00:16:57.590 --> 00:16:58.860
Get him out of here.

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:00.740
Don't dawdle.

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:07.490
Joe, what are you doing?

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:08.730
Clear out.

00:17:08.730 --> 00:17:10.410
Your act's over.

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:12.630
W-Wait a sec!

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.370
Give me another chance!

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:15.420
A chance?

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.130
That's right...

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:20.220
I'm going to marry Lady Lelia.

00:17:20.710 --> 00:17:22.290
Now, ladies and gentlemen!

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:23.960
I, Joe the knife-thrower,

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:26.520
am going to perform my 
greatest trick for you!

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:28.840
Interesting...

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:30.060
You heard him, folks!

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:32.990
Our knife-thrower Joe is going to

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:35.800
debut his new act for the first time ever!

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:38.570
Now, take a good look!

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:41.520
Oho, what's this?

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:43.590
Joe's lying down on the ground.

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:46.040
What's he going to do?

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:52.690
Remarkable!

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:56.110
The knife thrown into the air missed
Joe by the smallest margin!

00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:58.430
Joe himself is the target now!

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:00.760
Newton himself would be surprised!

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:04.860
First came the apple,
then came these knives!

00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:09.730
But will they be peeling any skin tonight?

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:30.900
Now then, next up is our
fire-breathing muscleman,

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:33.880
Dragon Thunder!

00:18:47.070 --> 00:18:49.420
The human rocket!

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:55.720
The wild beast tamer!

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:07.370
Now then, everyone,
it's time for our final act...

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:11.730
A team-up between the beautiful Lady Lelia
and Papyrus's most handsome young man,

00:19:11.730 --> 00:19:14.670
Mario, together in a trapeze act!

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:15.540
Don't do it!

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.780
Mario, don't swing on the trapeze!

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:21.850
It's a trick by the ringmaster!

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:23.780
He's not human...

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:26.240
He's a demon! He's death itself!

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:31.180
He's killing people to collect their souls
and passing it off as entertainment.

00:19:31.180 --> 00:19:32.710
And he's using me to do it!

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:36.480
Mario, if you use that trapeze, you will die!

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:38.490
Please, get down, now!

00:19:39.090 --> 00:19:40.990
I love you, Mario!

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:44.760
Don't worry, Lelia.

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:46.920
I won't make any mistakes.

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:49.480
I'll make this show go off without a hitch.

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:51.880
And once I become the star of this circus,

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:54.250
I'm going to propose to you.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:55.000
Mario...

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:57.410
Here I come, Lelia!

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:03.260
Mario!

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:20.530
Everyone...

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:24.320
Oh, dear, such a tragedy...

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:29.830
The Papyrus Grand Circus is now 
in unparalleled dire straits!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:35.160
So many of our brilliant members have
passed tonight in tragic accidents!

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:40.920
All that remain are a witless clown,
an aging ringmaster, and...

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:45.180
the beautiful, but helpless, Lady Lelia!

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:49.410
Please, please, would you help us?!

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:54.130
Would any of you join us,
and with your youthful talents,

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:59.270
create a new epoch in the
history of the Papyrus circus?!

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:00.840
If you have the talent,

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:03.400
you can become our marquee
performer... a star!

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:09.360
And once you're a star, you'll be able
to marry the beautiful Lady Lelia!

00:21:09.560 --> 00:21:11.460
Wh-What'd he say?

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:14.000
Marry that beauty?

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.850
I think I'll do it.

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:16.710
Me, too!

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:19.300
Please...

00:21:19.300 --> 00:21:22.580
Are there any among you who
think you can help us?

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:26.890
Lelia! Lelia!

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:30.320
Get down from there!

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:33.170
While the ringmaster's occupied,
we can get out of here!

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:36.270
What are you doing? Hurry!

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:38.860
He's a demon, isn't he?

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:40.980
Let's run away together!

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:52.410
Please... Someone save me...

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:04.050
Would you like to join us?

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.260
Collection
